# Retires the old Timmsy's Art site at timmsys-art.netlify.app.
#
# Netlify deploys this repository alongside GitHub Pages, so the same content
# was live on two addresses and competing with itself in search. Every request
# is now permanently redirected to the Cannon Art domain, which leaves one
# searchable site and passes any accumulated value to it.
#
# This file only affects Netlify. GitHub Pages builds with Jekyll, which skips
# files whose names begin with an underscore, so it never reaches the live site.
#
# Netlify rewrites links to drop the .html extension, so the retired site's
# addresses are extensionless and have to be mapped to the real .html pages by
# hand. The trailing "!" forces the redirect to win over the file Netlify still
# holds at that path.

/dc-characters       https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/dc-characters.html        301!
/marvel-characters   https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/marvel-characters.html    301!
/music-legends       https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/music-legends.html        301!
/recovery-art        https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/recovery-art.html         301!
/miscellaneous       https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/miscellaneous.html        301!
/batman              https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/batman.html               301!
/the-who             https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/the-who.html              301!
/rolling-stones      https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/rolling-stones.html       301!
/terms-of-use        https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/terms-of-use.html         301!
/control-panel       https://cannon-art.uk.eu.org/control-panel.html        301!

